  "content": "<html>\n<body>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">伸手可得</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓您與被裝飾品（如物品展示框、告示牌、旗幟和其他支援附件）隱藏的可用方塊互動。開啟箱子、使用合成台或存取其他方塊，而無須繞過您放置的裝飾品進行瞄準。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">該移除常見來源的挫敗感，同時保持正常的裝飾互動性，使有裝飾的建築更為實用。可選的空手模式有助於防止意外編輯、物品放置以及其他不想要的互動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">它適用於單人遊戲、專用服務器，甚至當服務器未安裝此模組時也能用於多人模式。為獲得最完整且一致的體驗，建議在客戶端和服務器上都安裝本模組。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖼️ 穿過裝飾品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">與物品展示框、發光物品展示框、告示牌和旗幟背後的可用方塊互動。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 更易存取隱藏儲存空間：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">開啟附著的容器（如箱子），而無須繞過裝飾性方塊或實體進行點擊。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 功能性方塊相容：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">即使被支援的裝飾品覆蓋，仍可使用箱子、合成台等互動式方塊。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌐 靈活的客戶端與服務器組合：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">適用於單機遊戲、伺服器端多人模式以及帶有限制的純客戶端多人模式。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🤝 雙方皆安裝體驗更佳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當客戶端與服務器皆安裝時，所有玩家之互動將保持一致性。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✋空手安全選項：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選地要求空手操作，以維持正常的裝飾互動性（例如在告示牌上放置物品）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ 自訂支援列表：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">設定哪些附著方塊與實體允許點擊穿透。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔌 模組相容擴充：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">包含對相容模組的支援，例如 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-item-frames\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">快速物品展示框</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，若存在該模組則會自動套用。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩客戶端安裝選擇性 / 服務器安裝選擇性</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(適用 FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(適用 FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (適用 FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接於遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（需於 Fabric 上安裝由 Prospector 所製作的 Mod Menu）。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">欲使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code>，命名格式依設定類型而定：<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有模組皆包含所有型別的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-anvils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/open-together\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/opentogether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/reachbehind/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n</body>\n</html>",
